WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
One medium bomb is lit beside Ryu after the prerequisite knockdown.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.450
The backdash makes Ryu’s recorded throw miss.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.250
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

4
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:02.900
The automatic bomb launch gives Kimberly time for the heavy-punch teleport.

5
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.400
Crouching heavy punch picks up the bomb juggle.

6
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.550
A second heavy-punch teleport repositions for standing medium punch.

7
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.400
Standing medium punch leads into Sprint launcher.

8
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.050
Heavy bomb plant spends one additional can and completes the setup.
